{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起自己最初连表达喜欢都紧张的样子，也想到如今已经能和对方亲近，心里慢慢柔软下来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、发酸、温热、平静、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"不想再逼自己得到永远不变的保证，以及决定不再把喜欢藏回去的态度，需要读第二、三段长句才能抓到。右侧的情感阶段变化也很难一眼扫全。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他回想从前喜欢一个人的紧张，发现如今还能亲近对方，于是不再急着追问以后，愿意接受当下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"柔软、发酸、温热、平静、眷恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的熟悉的摇荡、夜空最后一闪，以及开头没说完的话终于说完、熟悉声音远远回应等画面，需要逐句看才容易理解。第二段不索要保证和第三段不再隐藏喜欢的区别也不容易一次抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然珍惜眼下和对方的亲近，虽然不知道以后如何，但决定不再隐藏喜欢，也不强求未来的保证。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温热、平静、柔软、发酸、留恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"小船一下定住、站起来整理衣服、轻轻关上门这一串具体动作，以及醒来还记得光等细节，一眼难以抓到它们与人物处境的关系。中间一行新增内容较多，感受、动作和余韵挤在一起。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条同等醒目的长句同时争夺第一注意力，没有一个特别明确的核心入口。读完后能理解从回想过去、珍惜当下到不再隐藏喜欢的递进关系，但3秒扫读很难同时抓住人物处境和核心感受。随着文字增加，下方短语逐渐形成多组并列信息，尤其第三张中间的动作、感受和画面细节混在一起，虽然各自有一定关联，却不容易一眼判断它们分别在补充什么。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2bbfa006-5564-4131-917e-53656f7c1442", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003300112065Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:34:10.638461+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fe2726fb7bf4ef6e2dea6bfea85fbec23bca864f4a18cd76555257c7fd532bb1", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003300112065Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0758820c6e05b8dbc1c5536be5a12be8a40b661769b2b2adfb3fb6329a78f165"}}}
